  "subject": "A woman who runs a bicycle-repair shop beside a temple dips the same customer's back-tyre tube in the water basin every Tuesday and realises the single pinhole is made by his own pin; she patches it slowly anyway.",
  "caption": "Taiwanese torch-song jazz with a slow swing feel. Muted trumpet playing long phrases between vocal lines, upright piano comping soft seventh chords, upright bass walking, brushed drums. Warm vintage club room, close-miked, light plate reverb. Female vocal, smoky low alto register, relaxed unhurried delivery, clearly sung melody. Clear full voice, every word enunciated, steady sung melody on every line. 84 BPM, F minor. Wry, tender, late-night mood. No distorted guitar, no synth, no electronic beats, no autotune, no rap.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n廟邊的跤踏車店，拜二攏有伊\n一台單車，後輪攏無氣\n我共內胎浸落水盆\n細細粒氣泡，浮出來講話\n[Pre-Chorus]\n空，總是佇仝一个所在\n袂是釘仔，是針\n[Chorus]\n伊的氣漏漏，漏甲有節拍\n我補一擺，伊閣再來\n毋是車歹，是人過頭奸巧\n我嘛愛，拜二彼幾分鐘\n[Verse]\n我共補仔糊好，慢慢仔壓\n伊企佇邊仔，假裝看廟埕\n伊講：「頭家娘，今仔日閣漏氣」\n我講：「無要緊，我有時間」\n[Pre-Chorus]\n針仔藏佇伊的衫袋仔\n我佇水盆看甲清清楚楚\n[Chorus]\n伊的氣漏漏，漏甲有節拍\n我補一擺，伊閣再來\n毋是車歹，是人過頭奸巧\n我嘛愛，拜二彼個鐘點\n[Verse]\n今仔日伊無講，直接坐落\n我提補仔，伊提彼支針\n伊講：「這支，送你」\n[Bridge]\n針仔放佇桌頂，亮亮\n廟裡的鐘，敲一聲\n[Chorus]\n伊的氣滿滿，免閣補矣\n我共氣筒提予伊\n毋是車好，是人終於講\n我嘛愛，拜二外，逐日\n[Outro]\n後輪的氣，打甲飽飽\n拜二到矣，伊猶原來",
